---
const nowYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="bg-slate-900 text-slate-300 pt-16 pb-12 border-t border-slate-800 text-sm">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-8 mb-12">
      
      <!-- Col 1: About Wiki -->
      <div class="col-span-2">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4">
          <img 
            src="/images/avatar.webp" 
            alt="百科机场" 
            class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg object-cover shadow-sm ring-1 ring-slate-700 flex-shrink-0"
            width="32"
            height="32"
          />
          <span class="font-extrabold text-white text-lg tracking-tight">百科机场</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed mb-4 pr-6">
          百科机场 (jichangwiki.homes) 是面向中文用户的网络代理知识百科、客户端教程与品牌客观评测数据库。我们秉持数据可追溯、实测求真实、分类讲逻辑的原则，为用户选购代理服务提供中立参考与避坑指引。
        </p>
        <div class="p-3 bg-slate-800/80 rounded-lg border border-slate-700/60 text-[11px] text-slate-400 leading-normal">
          <span class="text-amber-400 font-semibold">⚠️ 推广合规披露：</span>
          本站部分品牌链接包含推荐代码（Affiliate Link）。若您通过链接注册，本站可能会获得少额运营佣金，这不会增加您的任何购买费用。我们始终标注数据来源，不向任何不合规宣称背书。
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 2: 选购与评测 -->
      <div>
        <h4 class="text-xs font-semibold text-white uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">选购与评测</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs">
          <li><a href="/airport/recommend/" class="hover:text-white transition">机场推荐总览</a></li>
          <li><a href="/airport/ranking/" class="hover:text-white transition">2026 综合排行榜</a></li>
          <li><a href="/pricing/cheap/" class="hover:text-white transition">便宜低价机场</a></li>
          <li><a href="/pricing/monthly/" class="hover:text-white transition">月付灵活机场</a></li>
          <li><a href="/pricing/lifetime/" class="hover:text-white transition">不限时流量套餐</a></li>
          <li><a href="/brands/directory/" class="hover:text-white transition">31+ 品牌数据库</a></li>
          <li><a href="/brands/guangsu/" class="text-blue-400 hover:text-blue-300 transition">主推：光速云详情</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 3: 客户端与技术 -->
      <div>
        <h4 class="text-xs font-semibold text-white uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">客户端与技术</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs">
          <li><a href="/clients/clash-verge/" class="hover:text-white transition">Clash Verge Rev</a></li>
          <li><a href="/clients/v2rayn/" class="hover:text-white transition">v2rayN Windows</a></li>
          <li><a href="/clients/shadowrocket/" class="hover:text-white transition">Shadowrocket 小火箭</a></li>
          <li><a href="/clients/sing-box/" class="hover:text-white transition">sing-box 新生态</a></li>
          <li><a href="/network/iepl/" class="hover:text-white transition">IEPL 专线科普</a></li>
          <li><a href="/network/iplc/" class="hover:text-white transition">IPLC 专线对比</a></li>
          <li><a href="/streaming-ai/chatgpt/" class="hover:text-white transition">ChatGPT 解锁节点</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 4: 教程与风控 -->
      <div>
        <h4 class="text-xs font-semibold text-white uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">排障与风控</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs">
          <li><a href="/tutorials/subscription/" class="hover:text-white transition">订阅导入教程</a></li>
          <li><a href="/tutorials/tun-mode/" class="hover:text-white transition">TUN 模式开启</a></li>
