          <li><a href="/risk/avoid-scams/" class="hover:text-white transition">机场避坑指南</a></li>
          <li><a href="/risk/refunds/" class="hover:text-white transition">退款售后维权</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Bottom Disclaimer & Copyright -->
    <div class="pt-8 border-t border-slate-800 text-[11px] text-slate-500 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4">
      <div>
        &copy; 2020 - {nowYear} 百科机场 (jichangwiki.homes). 纯静态独立技术知识库.
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 text-slate-400">
        <a href="/about/" class="hover:underline">关于我们与评测标准</a>
        <span>·</span>
        <a href="/privacy/" class="hover:underline">隐私政策与免责声明</a>
        <span>·</span>
        <a href="/brands/official/" class="hover:underline">品牌官网验证</a>
        <span>·</span>
        <a href="/search/" class="hover:underline">全站索引</a>
      </div>
